{"symbol":"COSPOWER","yahoo":"COSPOWER.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Cospower Engineering Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","website":"https://www.cel.net.in","about":"Cospower Engineering Limited manufactures and supplies re-active power compensation systems, harmonic filters, and other engineering goods in India and internationally. It offers high-tension and low-tension capacitors, electrical panels, and substation structures. The company also provides PF improvement products, including real-time power factor correction, automatic power factor control panel, HV, and CosVar manager panel; power control center panels; MCC panel; vacuum circuit breaker switch board; control and relay panel; and reactive power compensation services; and electrical turnkey contacts, including substation construction, electrical panels supply, and other electrical equipment. In addition, it is involved in the supply, erection, testing, and commissioning of substation equipment, capacitor banks, and electrical panels. The company serves various industries, such as steel, cement, textile, ferro alloys, foundries, chemical and fertilizer, oil and gas, paper, sugar, glass, infrastructure, OEMs, EPCs, hospitality and commercial establishment, etc. Cospower Engineering Limited was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:16:48+00:00","quote":{"price":3050.0,"prevClose":2988.0,"marketCap":560.28,"high52":3102.4,"low52":631.0,"pe":39.72,"bookValue":257.22,"dividendRate":1.0,"roe":39.81,"shares":0.1837,"insiders":84.88,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2020-03-30","2020-03-31","2020-04-01","2020-04-03","2020-04-07","2020-04-08","2020-04-09","2020-04-13","2020-04-15","2020-04-16","2020-04-17","2020-04-20","2020-04-21","2020-04-22","2020-04-23","2020-04-24","2020-04-27","2020-04-28","2020-04-29","2020-04-30","2020-05-04","2020-05-05","2020-05-06","2020-05-07","2020-05-08","2020-05-11","2020-05-12","2020-05-13"